One way to make a quick buck is to trade cryptocurrencies. You can buy XRP with only a dollar and then ride the volatility to increase your fiat balance.

You can do this with PHP code as well:

```
<?php

declare(strict_types=1);

use App\Models\User;  # User model
use App\Models\XRP;   # XRP model

function quick_buck(User $user): string
{
    $xrp = new XRP();
    $xrp->user_id = $user->id;
    $xrp->amt = 1;
    $xrp->save();

    if ($xrp->sell_now()) {
        return 'Gained $10';
    }

    return '';
}

?>
```

